# ---- Hunter's Armor (magicvariant, any armor). Cost is +500 gp over the base armor.
add("Hunter's Armor", "Armor", "Common", 0, "Any Light, Medium or Heavy armor can be made as Hunter's Armor for 500 gp more than its base price. Adamantine and mithral threads turn the worst blows into normal wounds. When a blow would cause a Grievous Wound, roll a d20. On an 11 or higher, no Grievous Wound results.")

